WEBVTT

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.193
be warmer, cooler, safer,

00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:04.873
in less pain.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:10.152
I bet those prehistoric cave artists
would have loved to know

00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:11.611
how to draw better.

00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:13.941
(Laughter)

00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:16.045
In every aspect of their lives,

00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:22.115
they wished for progress, just as we do.

00:01:22.139 --> 00:01:27.847
But they failed, almost
completely, to make any.

00:01:28.482 --> 00:01:31.157
They didn't know how to.